		<TRID_INFO>
			<TRAN tranid="obtro_oder_103r" trcode="obtro_oder_103r" compress="1" encryption="1" inputcheck="1" useattr="0" />
		</TRID_INFO>
		<TRIO_INFO>
			<TRAN name="obtro_oder_103r" title="해외주식 온라인 미체결 주문내?" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="525" _ulen="385" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
